{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうだよ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アクセルホッパーだよ!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポン ポン スポポーンヽ(*´▽)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなが教えてくれたから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アクセルホッパー様が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"脳内からお帰りになった〜ヽ(*´▽)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい、すみません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この記事、確か一週間前くらいに書いていたのですが......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜発表だ、なんやかんやで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"更新するタイミングを完全に見失ってました_(._.)_"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ですが、折角書いてた記事なので...少し内容を変更して投稿させて頂きます!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッスンで履きつぶしたシューズ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言っても、レッスン以外でも履いていたけど(笑←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日から(多分...先週の火曜日；??)新しいレッスンシューズにしたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/09/8252741/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/09/8252741/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私にはハイカットは合わないらしい!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"靴底が固いのは嫌だったから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"柔らかいやつにしましたー★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早速履いてみた感想"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気に入ったーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/09/8252741/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん質問が集まって嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/09/8252741/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん、ありがとうございます!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"予想よりもたくさんしてくださったので、その中から"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふっと目についた質問を、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その時の直感、緩めな回答で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくつかお返事しますので......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/09/8252741/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では早速。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊日村さんに買ってもらうはずだった加湿器、結局は自分で買ったの？それとも未だに買えてない？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":">>>まだ買ってないのよ〜；；"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そろそろ欲しい季節になってきたよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/09/8252741/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、夜寝るときにつけておくスチーマー??を買ったから、毎日つけて寝てるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/09/8252741/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊朝起きたらドラえもんになっていたらどうしますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":">>>出来ることならなりたくないよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、朝起きて横にドラえもんがいたら.........四次元ポケット。利用させていただく手はないでしょ(腹黒笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊れーかさんの一番好きな町はどこですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":">>>んー。函館かなぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"函館の夜景は、東京とか都会の夜景とはまた違って、とにかくめちゃくちゃキレイなんだよなぁ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さい頃からおばあちゃん家に行った時は、必ずみんなで観に行くんだよー＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後は、町というか、表参道と宮崎の海沿いの雰囲気がスゴく好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/09/8252741/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊玲香の飼ってるペットはいますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":">>>飼ってないんだよ；；"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、昔ハムスターだけ飼ったことがある!!名前は、チェリーとチロだった＊懐かしいなぁ(笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"因みに、桜井家は家族全員『ネコ派』です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/09/8252741/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊この連休で開かれた国体のラグビーで愛知県代表としてみんなで戦い５位になることができました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":">>>県の代表!５位!おめでとう(*^▽^)/★*☆♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラグビーはチームプレー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲間との絆、チームワークがしっかりとあったからこその結果ですね♪これからも頑張って、またhappyな報告待ってるねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/09/8252741/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先ずはこのくらいかなぁ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また少しずつ答えていきます!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと着るタイミングをはかっていたカーディガン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/09/8252741/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は寒かったから、初着用しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/09/8252741/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/09/8252741/0010.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}